KARTE HAIN HUM KARBALA KE BEKASO KA ARBAEEN<br>
<br>
 AAGAYE HOKAR REHA ZINDAAN SE AHLE HARAM,<br>
KEHTI HAI BHAIYI KI TURBAT PA BAHEN RUDAD-E-GHAM,<br>
 JIS QADAR HONE THE HUM PAR HOGAYE ZULM-O-SITAM,<br>
 HIL RAHI THI BAIN SE ZAINAB KE KARBAL SE ZAMEEN<br>
<br>
QABR PAR ABBAS KI YE BAIN THE KULSOOM KE,<br>
 SILSILA DAR SILSILA TUJH PAR SITAM HOTE RAHE,<br>
 CHEED GAYI MASHK-E-SAKINA KATGAYE BAZOO TERE,<br>
 LAASH THI TERI KAHI AUR SAR THA NAIZE PAR KAHIN<br>
<br>
EK MAA KE BAIN SE GOONJI FUGHAAYE KARBALA,<br>
 HAYE QASIM KIS QADAR PAMAAL THA LAASHA TERA,<br>
 HADH YE HAI KE JISM TERA TUKDE TUKDE HOGAYA,<br>
 PARA PARA JAISE HO AURAQ QURAAN-E-MUBEEN<br>
<br>
 US ZAMEEN PAR KI NAZAR JAB ABID-E-DILGIR NE,<br>
 AAKHRI SAJDA KIYA JIS PAR ADA SHABBIR NE,<br>
JABKE DEKHA THA WO MANZAR SHAH KI HAMSHEER NE,<br>
 DIL BHAR AAYA GIR PADI GASH KHAKE KE SAJJADE HAZEEN<br>
<br>
THI SADA LAILA KI AAYE AKBAR MERE KARYAL JAWAAN,<br>
 LOOT KE AAYI HAI DAYARE SHAAM SE BEKAS KI MAA,<br>
 SO RAHE HO BAAP KE PEHLU MAIN KHAKAR SINA,<br>
LOUT KAR MAIN AB WATAN JAYO NAHIN HARGIZ NAHIN<br>
<br>
QABR ABBASE JARI PAR AAKE ZAINAB NE KAHA,<br>
 KAT GAYE BAZOO TUMHARE CHEEN GAYI SAR SE RIDA,<br>
 AB WATAN JANE KO HAI YE BEKASO KA QAFELA,<br>
LO SALAME AAKHRI AAYE DILBARE UMMUL BANEEN<br>
<br>
QABR PAR SARWAR KI RO RO KE BANO NE KAHA,<br>
 QAID MEIN BALI SAKINA HOGAYI HUMSE JUDA,<br>
 BANGAYA USKA KAFAN JOPAIRAHAN THA KHOON BHARA,<br>
 DAFN KARKE RORAHE THE JISKO ZAINUL ABIDEEN<br>
<br>
GHAM ZADA BIBI KE DIL KEBAS YEHI ARMAAN THA,<br>
 SAARE AALAM MEIN BAHATTAR KA HO CHEHLUM DHOOM SE,<br>
 BE KAFAN JALTI ZAMEEN PAR JISKA THA LAASHA PADHA,<br>
HUM AZADAROON KO HAI TA HASHR KARNA ARBAEEN..